ars several years after her death to Jinta and asks him to reunite their group of friends so her wish can be granted. Yet, she does not seem to remember what is her wish, but she knows she has to reunite her friends in order to remember. Despite being \"dead\", she is a very positive, energetic and lively person. According to Jinta, she is quite selfless and cries very often for others when they are hurt or upset, but not for herself."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58079"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/551985e5a82d45f89eb417f9e4577e4b8f6b5a4401ae4cd9b3735dcea69e8ba5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d03439d214ed1ea41ddc9aaf27f160d2e55bdf14025011779f8f84d8ddef94eb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"茅野 愛衣","creatorId":"vndb:s630","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s630","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s630","name":"茅野 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45998","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c58080","characterName":"安城 鳴子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c58080"},"originalCharacterName":"安城 鳴子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Naruko is a childhood friend of Jinta and Menma. While she displays a cold attitude towards Jinta, she is secretly concerned for him. She is perhaps the closest to him at present and is enrolled the same school (although Jinta stopped attending school). Chiriko comments that Naruko has not changed over the years: she is still easily persuaded by everyone around her. Naruko seems to be popular in high school and gets along well with girls that Chiriko deems \"sluts.\" However, she works at a video game store and has a large collection of manga and video games herself."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58080"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d06f84076e161a998dc3e86f6c316799343f923671dc49a5fd6e520568ed2d5e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0de923265df4fcd0bbfa5109add3e3acb79b8043f85f2939d04a0b0a78a79617.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"戸松 遥","creatorId":"vndb:s5478","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5478","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5478","name":"戸松 遥","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:46003","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c58084","characterName":"鶴見 知利子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c58084"},"originalCharacterName":"鶴見 知利子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend of Menma and Jinta. As a child, Chiriko was a shy girl and a member of the Super Peace Busters. Now, she is enrolled at an elite school with Matsuyuki. Currently, she is ranked fourth in her class. She is serious, stoic, and cocky. She has feelings for Matsuyuki, but shows contempt for him whenever she sees that he has not gotten over Meiko's death."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58084"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1cc2ca011eef09c585e2f99e0b346757dee8292206b5ddaa8106ef07da317373.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2085f175af12635e4cc61f84ee00abb8ca9eafc23418ad984f93fd5b768dd70.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"早見 沙織","creatorId":"vndb:s1871","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1871","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1871","name":"早見 沙織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:46000","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c58087","characterName":"松雪 集","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c58087"},"originalCharacterName":"松雪 集","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"181"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"68"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend of Menma and Jinta. In the present, Atsumu holds a condescending attitude towards Jinta. He becomes agitated when Menma is mentioned and is still distraught over her death. He, together with Chiriko, attend the same high school, which Jinta failed the entrance exams to enter. Atsumu and Chiriko were once mistaken as a pair due to how close they are. Atsumu is handsome, athletic, and popular, but still trapped by the memory of Meiko. He keeps a white sundress similar to hers in his closet."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58087"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/975645e7952d1422ece7c5cfb0864dc5a148a93924d7632194c3e73d111e7d6e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9ee59ffc5ec79138e385815e20e4ccc22b2161c6fee179063d50e8af5855b26f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井 孝宏","creatorId":"vndb:s50","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s50","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s50","name":"櫻井 孝宏","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45997","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"瀬戸 麻沙美","creatorId":"vndb:s1433","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1433","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1433","name":"瀬戸 麻沙美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45999","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c58092","characterName":"久川 鉄道","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c58092"},"originalCharacterName":"久川 鉄道","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"185"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend of Menma and Jinta. During their childhood, Poppo was uncontrollably energetic and friendly and always loyal to Jinta, recognizing him as the leader of the group; this hasn't changed at all even in the present. He admits that he was always grateful to the group for including him as he was an awkward child. Although he has dropped out of school, he is a world traveler who earns money by taking various part-time jobs and lives in their old secret base when not abroad. Poppo seems to have questionable interests: Jinta found several pornographic magazines upon entering the clubhouse. Poppo also seems to have an obsession for foreign girls, especially Vietnamese girls. Overall, he has a lewd personality."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58092"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/49f86ad7d9a09fc7fdc8195a2423883544988425e1c219941d4fdf1303f79478.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67c7b6b4f7e487e09b8f0170a43d7fc2bff54930bf898ad86b8b057b660874a5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"近藤 孝行","creatorId":"vndb:s2121","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2121","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2121","name":"近藤 孝行","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:46001","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"豊崎 愛生","creatorId":"vndb:s6857","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6857","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6857","name":"豊崎 愛生","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:46004","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c58096","characterName":"宿海 仁太","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c58096"},"originalCharacterName":"宿海 仁太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"416"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the series and the only person who is able to see Menma. As a child, Jinta was the de facto leader of the self-proclaimed Super Peace Busters. Jinta was energetic and outgoing during his childhood, but became withdrawn and isolated after the deaths of Meiko and his mother. After Meiko's death the Super Peace Busters drifted apart and Jinta eventually became a hikikomori, refusing to go to school and confining himself to his home."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58096"}],"profileFacts":[],"metad